From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Backport Qt 6.11.1 compatibility fix to wfview 2.11

Adapt upstream commit b26c898c219df8935dcb85969465ed995f64d875 to
the source layout and surrounding context in wfview 2.11.

QMultiMap::remove compares values through a const iterator in Qt 6.11.1
and later. Make queueItem's equality operator callable on const values.

Upstream: https://gitlab.com/eliggett/wfview/-/merge_requests/51
Fixes: https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/562961

diff --git a/cachingqueue.h b/cachingqueue.h
--- a/cachingqueue.h
+++ b/cachingqueue.h
@@ -39,7 +39,7 @@ struct queueItem {
     uchar receiver;
     bool recurring;
     qint64 id = QDateTime::currentMSecsSinceEpoch();
-    bool operator==(const queueItem& lhs)
+    bool operator==(const queueItem& lhs) const
     {
         return (lhs.command == command && lhs.receiver == receiver && lhs.recurring == recurring);
     }
